{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2022-05-11 10:00:00', 'title': "NORFOLK SOUTHERN'S $500 MILLION IN GREEN BONDS FUNDS LOW-CARBON INITIATIVES", 'text': 'ATLANTA , MAY 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION\xa0(NYSE: NSC) TODAY RELEASED A REPORT ON PROJECTS FUNDED BY THE $500 MILLION IN GREEN BONDS ISSUED BY THE COMPANY IN 2021. THE REPORT PROVIDES A COMPREHENSIVE OVERVIEW OF THE FUNDED PROJECTS, AS WELL AS EXPECTED ENVIRONMENTAL AND SOCIAL BENEFITS.'}